        "content": "$$X_C = \\frac{1}{\\omega C} = \\frac{1}{2\\pi f C}$$\n\n電容的阻抗：$Z_C = -jX_C = \\frac{1}{j\\omega C}$\n\n電壓落後電流 90°：$V_C = \\frac{I}{j\\omega C}$"
